\begin{enumerate}
\item Hold a small mirror in one hand.
\item Ask your partner to stand about three metres away from you.
\item Move the mirror so that some light from the room is reflected into your partner's eyes.
\item Ask your partner if they saw any light from the mirror.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection*{Materials}
